{"id":"bb78d8a03236bc57","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment.md","title":"Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas","display":"df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment","aliases":["72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment"],"display":"df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, Lemma 1.10 and proof, printed p. 415, PDF p. 427; section 1.6 Remark (i), printed p. 413, PDF p. 425","source_relation":"Explicit conjunction-implication-universal fragment corresponding to the source existential-free formulas after its defined-disjunction convention","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; least-stage construction and source fragment convention checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, Lemma 1.10 and proof, printed p. 415, PDF p. 427; section 1.6 Remark (i), printed p. 413, PDF p. 425"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"Explicit conjunction-implication-universal fragment corresponding to the source existential-free formulas after its defined-disjunction convention"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; least-stage construction and source fragment convention checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a> 的项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_a\">\\(\\mathcal T_a\\)</span>、公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal A_a\\)</span> 和自由构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,i\\in\\omega\">\\(n,i\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下阶段并引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\">\\(\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>。它使用原子、假、合取、蕴涵和全称构造子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_n\">\\(H_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\">\\(\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中定义，不预先假设闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\n\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in H_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\ A\\in H_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\n\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in H_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\ A\\in H_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.413 将析取作为含存在量词的缩写，所以其“无存在量词”也排除析取；p.415 Lemma 1.10 的证明逐项列出原子、合取、全称、蕴涵的典范实现者。本书的算术语法把析取作为原始构造子，若只按字面排除存在量词，会错误地扩大自实现性结论。因此这里明确建立同时无存在量词、无析取的负片段，沿用源文证明的真实范围。</p>\n<p>阶段并存在于集合元语言，每一阶段仍为公式子集；阶段递增且合并产生最小闭包。对象语言否定是蕴涵到假公式的缩写，故闭于否定。此定义没有宣称包含所有与负公式等价的公式；那是原书 Lemma 1.10(iii) 的另一断言，本次未形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的项集 $\\mathcal T_a$、公式集 $\\mathcal A_a$ 和自由构造子；$n,i\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"n,i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"H_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_a^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"H_0\\coloneqq\\{t=_a s:t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\}\\cup\\{\\bot_a\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H_{n+1}\\coloneqq H_n\\cup\n\\{A\\land_a B,A\\to_a B:A,B\\in H_n\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall_a x_i A:i\\in\\omega,\\ A\\in H_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_a^{-}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}H_n.","display":true}],"bytes":2457,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-315","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment|df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas](72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment|df-negative-arithmetic-fragment — Negative fragment of arithmetic formulas]]"},{"id":"75662f8a477e661f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a^{-}$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，其中 $\\mathcal A_a^{-}$ 由 [[72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]] 定义。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-negative-arithmetic-fragment]]"}],"outgoing":["b0118b1d3360ec7d"]}